  text "Oriel stops the worker running your sessions as it quits." @564,424.32806 #ece6d8 Inter 12.5
  text "It quits when these turns end, or in 42s; their agents come back when Oriel opens" @564,450.9682 #b3ab99 Inter 12
  text "again." @564,468.48773 #b3ab99 Inter 12
  text "Round half-even" @564,501.11227 #ece6d8 JetBrains Mono 11.5
  text "mid-turn" @682.0469,500.75226 #7c7566 JetBrains Mono 10.5
  text "Scheduled jobs don't run while Oriel is closed: one that comes due runs once" @564,528.18726 #ff9b45 Inter 12
  text "when it opens again." @564,545.7068 #ff9b45 Inter 12
  text "Sweep stale deps" @564,574.3313 #ece6d8 JetBrains Mono 11.5
  text "every weekday 07:00" @689.25,573.9713 #7c7566 JetBrains Mono 10.5
